<title>USA: Gibbs Construction Inc Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Gibbs Construction Inc Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>GARLAND, Texas 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.18   profit	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net     profit	     762   profit	   489</p>
<p> Revs			16,079		   10,002</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $1.18   profit	 $0.36</p>
<p> Net	loss	    4,074   profit	 1,094</p>
<p> Revs			31,906		   24,755</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1995 figures are pro forma to reflect income as though the company were not taxed as a Subchapter S corporation and also include effects of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Per share income from continuing operations was $0.20 for the 1996 third quarter compared to pro forma $0.19 from a year-ago. Nine-month income for 1996 nine-months is $0.16 per share, compared to pro forma $0.42 per share for the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
